# Lines without the marker between the records of a frame are ignored and not counted.
!noise some engine message before the frame
CURIA1|100|BEGIN|0|0.1.0|1066|9|15|1001|Test Ruler One
!noise an error entry
!noise    that continues on a second line
CURIA1|100|FIN|312|78
!noise CURIA2|100|FIN|1|2 is another marker version
CURIA1|100|HEIR|none
!noise -
CURIA1|100|END|4
!noise after the frame
